  "comment": "One fixture for the Plans reading of a listing, on both sides: apiserver.PlanGroups (what group=plans adds to a CardList) and web/src/grouping.ts (what the Team, Me and Backlog boards draw in Plans). `cards` is a listing in its order, as the wire carries it (status.lineage, root first; a review card carries its task's chain, which may end at the task itself). A card's plan item is the nearest lineage entry with a level; a subtask is in no group. `me` groups per zone (urgent, unplanned, planned, niceToHave), each plan item gathered where its first card stands; `team` the same per cell, a person (in order of first appearance, \"\" for nobody) by zone, a card in every column of its assignees; `backlog` cuts the one list into runs of neighbouring cards of one plan item. `plan` \"\" is Ungrouped.",
